      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "Top-5 重定位候选：\n\n1. Baricitinib (RA)\n   JAK→IFN-α→pDC ★\n2. Belimumab\n   已批准 (校验)\n\n3. Anifrolumab\n   已批准 (校验)\n\n4. Tofacitinib (RA)\n5. Daratumumab\n   ✦ 新假设",
